{"version":1,"content":"<p>德國職業田徑運動員Alica Schmidt有「女飛人」之稱，由於天生一副「明星相」，因而被封為「全球最火辣運動員」之一。</p><p>不過Alica似乎不大滿意網民與傳媒只投放目光在其樣兒與身材上，她希望大眾留意她在跑場上的實力！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T14:11:49.038215+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T14:01:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T14:05:17.745742+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T14:05:17.745742+00:00","content_hash":"9f1f67f511a78996819ad0266c93d67c4241fea41be9a37bae4f18951ed5ffce","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}